 # Development handover
 ## #281 executable handover — native tree proof
 
-Branch `work/sol281-native-detachment-20261027`, executed source `41dc25ca060ecb07cef15c1640feeb9f6cce1eb4`, contains the [experimental native-tree laboratory](../systems/solid-detachment.md). [Initial motion evidence](../audits/2026-10-27-sol281-native-tree.md) and [compound Sand/Water evidence](../audits/2026-10-27-sol281-compound-cellular-coupling.md) now cover actual Linux/Windows Rapier, six exact hole-preserving proxies and session replacement. Preserve cumulative unresolved counts and do not claim production coupling. Next: reactive Wood/heterogeneous bonds, broader material cases, dynamic desoliding/fracture, persistence, cost/feel, runtime publication and independent/fu